<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="concept_pqq_bkb_tkc">
    <title>设备无法开机怎么办？</title>
    <conbody>
        <p>请依次检查：</p>
        <ul id="ul_i1t_kkb_tkc">
            <li>电源是否接通</li>
            <li>插座是否有电</li>
            <li>电源线是否损坏</li>
        </ul>
        <p>如果仍无法开机，请联系售后。</p>
    </conbody>
</concept>
